  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Urban Aquaculture Development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project focuses on the transformation, intensification, and expansion of sustainable aquaculture in urban and peri-urban settings by providing efficient, inclusive, resilient, and sustainable aquatic food systems. tilizing digital technologies and data platforms, the project will implement data-generating software to aid decision-making, leading to more efficient and sustainable agri-food systems in urban and peri-urban areas that enhance environmental, social, legal, and economic sustainability. Consequently, this will result in improved product quality and safety, better animal health, and enhanced worker safety, while also reducing the risk of disease outbreaks on farms and simultaneously tackling urban poverty, food insecurity, and malnutrition.</narrative>
  </description>
